(Outdated dependencies may expose the application to publicly discovered vulnerabilities.) Tj
T*
(Many of the largest breaches to date have relied on exploiting known vulnerabilities in outdated) Tj
T*
(components. The Clef and Go-sila code repositories draw from many outdated) Tj
T*
(components, albeit without currently well-known vulnerabilities. The risk is proportional to) Tj
T*
(component functional and data sensitivity, development activity and quality, popularity, and) Tj
T*
(length of time between project dependency updates. The OWASP project lists this risk on the) Tj
T*
(Ten Most Critical Web Application Security Risks 11 due to the widespread prevalence of this) Tj
T*
(issue.) Tj
T*
(The signer/rules/rules.go code utilizes signer/rules/deps/bindata.go to essentially) Tj
T*
(load the ?bignumber.js? library for arbitrary-precision decimal and non-decimal arithmetic.) Tj
T*
(The source of this library is signer/rules/deps/bignumber.js which is version 2.0.3. The) Tj
T*
(changelog for this project 12 indicates that this version was released in February 2015, and) Tj
T*
(that the most recent version is 7.2.1. NCC Group is not aware of any publicly known vulnerabilities in) Tj
T*
(this library.) Tj
T*
(The vendor/vendor.json file lists approximately 154 Golang dependencies with revision) Tj
T*
(timestamps ranging from early 2015 to August 2018. The majority of these are out of date) Tj
T*
(and can be updated. For example, there seven components sourced from a UPnP client) Tj
T*
(library for Go repository at https://github.com/huin/goupnp with a commit hash of 6795) Tj
T*
(07af18f3c7ba2bcc7905392ce23e148661c3 made on December 2016 which is 11 commits) Tj
T*
(out of date.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommendation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Update the project dependencies to the most recent and stable versions recommended for) Tj
T*
(production deployment. Include a regular review of dependency freshness as part of the) Tj
T*
(development process.) Tj
