T*
(When Clef receives a request through its exposed API, metadata is displayed to the user in) Tj
T*
(charge of handling it. This metadata includes a variety of fields unrelated to what is being) Tj
T*
(signed like IP address, user-agent, origin, etc. There are 6 calls to showMetadata\(\) within) Tj
T*
(signer/core/cliui.go that drive this functionality. Some of these fields can be trivially) Tj
